{"strongs": "H0441", "word": "אַלּוּף", "translit": "al.luph", "root": "אלל", "morph": "H:A-M", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "tame", "definition": "I. אַלּוּף adjective tame — ׳ א absolute Mic 7:5 +; construct Prov 2:17 +; suffix אַלּוּפֵי Ps 55:14 plural אַלֻּפִים Jer 13:21 suffix אַלֻּפֵינוּ Ps 144:14 , etc.; — 1. tame, docile , כֶּבֶשׂ אַלּוּף a docile (gentle) lamb Jer 11:19 . 2. noun masculine friend, intimate Ps 55:14 (|| מְיֻדָּע ) Mic 7:5 (|| רֵעַ ) Prov 16:28 ; Prov 17:9 ; Jer 13:21 of a woman's husband נְעוּרֶיהָ ׳ א Prov 2:17 figurative of ׳ י as husband of Judah, id. , Jer 3:4 . 3. i. q. I. אֶלֶף ; אַלּוּפֵינוּ מְסֻבָּלִים Ps 144:14 (i.e. cows).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB503')\">BDB503</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H441')\">H441</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB502')\">BDB502</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB504')\">BDB504</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>אַלּוּף</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>tame</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Mic 7:5\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,5)\">Mic 7:5</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Prov 2:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,17)\">Prov 2:17</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>אַלּוּפֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 55:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,14)\">Ps 55:14</ref> plural <bdbheb>אַלֻּפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 13:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,21)\">Jer 13:21</ref> suffix <bdbheb>אַלֻּפֵינוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 144:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,14)\">Ps 144:14</ref>, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>tame, docile</highlight>, <bdbheb>כֶּבֶשׂ אַלּוּף</bdbheb> <highlight>a docile</highlight> (gentle) <highlight>lamb</highlight> <ref ref=\"Jer 11:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,19)\">Jer 11:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. noun masculine</b> <highlight>friend, intimate</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 55:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,14)\">Ps 55:14</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מְיֻדָּע</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Mic 7:5\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,5)\">Mic 7:5</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רֵעַ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Prov 16:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,28)\">Prov 16:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 17:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,17,9)\">Prov 17:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,21)\">Jer 13:21</ref> of a woman's husband <bdbheb>נְעוּרֶיהָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 2:17\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(20,2,17)\">Prov 2:17</ref> figurative of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> as husband of Judah, <highlight>id.</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Jer 3:4\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(24,3,4)\">Jer 3:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> i. q. I. <bdbheb>אֶלֶף</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>אַלּוּפֵינוּ מְסֻבָּלִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 144:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,14)\">Ps 144:14</ref> (i.e. cows). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Mic 7:5", "book": "MIC", "chapter": 7, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Prov 2:17", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 2, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Ps 55:14", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 55, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 13:21", "book": "JER", "chapter": 13, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ps 144:14", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 144, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 11:19", "book": "JER", "chapter": 11, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Prov 1